# Ghost Vacuum: "Each of them is a 1/1 Spirit in addition to its other types." The creatures enter as that (CR 614.12), so what watches creatures
# enter sees a 1/1: Kiora, Behemoth Beckoner's "Whenever a creature you control with power 4 or greater enters, draw a card" does not draw for the
# Craw Wurm, a 6/4 on every other day of its life, that Bot1 destroys on turn 3, exiles with the Vacuum, and releases on turn 5. It would draw
# if the Wurm entered as the 6/4 and was made 1/1 afterwards.

